skin, or contemporary fashion-editorial styling.\n\nKeep the characters, Keep the skin detail, Keep the same environment, same frame structure. \n\nRemove all AI-noise, AI-artifacts\n","name":"Text Node 18"},"width":503,"height":496,"style":{"width":503,"height":496},"measured":{"width":503,"height":496},"selected":false,"dragging":false,"resizing":false},{"id":"imageUpload-gCTQ8ieQRDuoIkfPMIt0Y","type":"imageUpload","position":{"x":13135.819227661697,"y":1717.8598725247673},"data":{"imageUrl":"{{user-upload}}","filename":"S6_1_Mum.png","uploadStatus":"completed","errorMessage":null,"mediaWidth":1024,"mediaHeight":1024,"mediaUrl":"{{user-upload}}","name":"Image Upload 6"},"width":320,"height":401,"style":{"width":320,"height":401},"measured":{"width":320,"height":401},"selected":false,"dragging":false},{"id":"imageUpload-o51XjFmtXMHHcHWaDL6bT","type":"imageUpload","position":{"x":15869.359238697396,"y":97.43163578411668},"data":{"imageUrl":"{{user-upload}}","filename":"IMG_3348.JPG","uploadStatus":"completed","errorMessage":null,"mediaWidth":4284,"mediaHeight":5712,"mediaUrl":"{{user-upload}}","name":"Size1"},"width":320,"height":498,"style":{"width":320,"height":498},"measured":{"width":320,"height":498},"selected":false,"dragging":false},{"id":"textNode-ts9hdYu7-LgL9tQFGTHCi","type":"textNode","position":{"x":14644.427836845833,"y":-131.63536241310106},"data":{"text":"Create a photorealistic premium lifestyle advertising photograph set in a rural Southeast Asian countryside during warm late-afternoon sunlight. An older Southeast Asian woman mum2 sits at a rustic wooden table beside a rice field, wearing a slightly weathered white-and-green motorcycle helmet, a deep green long-sleeve shirt over a colorful patterned blouse, patterned traditional-style trousers, and a woven checked towel draped naturally over one shoulder. She has a warm, gentle, authentic smile and natural facial wrinkles and skin texture.\n\nShe is pouring steaming hot water from an old brushed-metal kettle into a red-and-cream packaged food bag product1 placed upright on the wooden table in front of her. Visible steam rises naturally from the pouring water and catches the sunlight. One hand holds the kettle while the other steadies the product package. The product package is clearly visible, upright, centered in the lower foreground, with realistic printed packaging, decorative traditional-inspired graphics and Thai-style typography follow product1. The product1 actual size is as small as a hand palm. (reference the size of the package in Size1)\n\nThe product package is the exact same physical package shown in product1. It must remain visually identical to the reference despite being placed into the new environment. Match the original packaging artwork, typography, colors, proportions and structure as closely as possible. Only change its photographic environment, lighting, perspective, and interaction with the character — never the product design itself.\n\nVisual style: a naturalistic French New Wave film aesthetic inspired by the intimate, observational cinema of Eric Rohmer. Bright natural daylight, soft summer sunlight, realistic outdoor locations, understated cinematic composition, candid everyday moments, relaxed and spontaneous body language, characters naturally integrated into their environment. Warm but restrained color palette with soft greens, pale blues, creamy whites and subtle earthy tones. Natural skin tones, gentle sunlight on faces, soft shadows, slightly lifted blacks and delicate film grain. Shot on 35mm film with a 50mm or 65mm lens, medium depth of field around f/3.5–f/5.6, realistic perspective, moderate subject-background separation, background remaining recognizable rather than heavily blurred. Slightly imperfect analog texture, soft highlight roll-off, natural exposure, subtle lens softness and authentic film color rendition. The image should feel observed rather than staged — quiet, spontaneous, intimate, youthful, conversational and effortlessly elegant. Avoid glossy commercial photography, dramatic lighting, heavy color grading, excessive contrast, artificial bokeh, HDR, extreme sharpness, overly polished skin, or contemporary fashion-editorial styling.\n\nAvoid: studio lighting, artificial beauty retouching, plastic skin, extreme HDR, excessive sharpness, extreme bokeh, oversaturated colors, heavy orange-and-teal grading, dramatic Hollywood lighting, perfect symmetry, artificial-looking steam, CGI appearance.\n","name":"Text Node 19"},"width":670,"height":849,"style":{"width":670,"height":849},"measured":{"width":670,"height":849},"selected":false,"dragging":false,"resizing":false},{"id":"imageGenerator-gFcDjM7jgbALWpbxcmy88","type":"imageGenerator","position":{"x":15518.638024054468,"y":-476.08632701392327},"data":{"model":"gpt-image","status":"completed","resultImage":"{{user-upload}}","errorMessage":null,"name":"Image 220","resolution":"","aspectRatio":"","quality":"high","imageSize":"landscape_4_3","results":[{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-17T03:37:57.759Z","runIndex":0},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-17T03:40:17.672Z","runIndex":1},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-17T03:42:05.303Z","runIndex":2},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-17T03:44:26.253Z","runIndex":3},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-17T03:46:47.071Z","runIndex":4},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-17T03:48:26.965Z","runIndex":5},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-17T03:53:41.859Z","runIndex":6},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-17T03:56:00.312Z","runIndex":7}],"activeRunIndex":7,"mediaWidth":1168,"mediaHeight":880},"width":540,"height":523,"style":{"width":540,"height":523},"measured":{"width":540,"height":523},"selected":false,"dragging":false,"resizing":false},{"id":"imageUpload-YOZ-toi08TZAOOJPSLTqi","type":"imageUpload","position":{"x":1470