nlight on faces, soft shadows, slightly lifted blacks and delicate film grain. Shot on 35mm film with a 50mm or 65mm lens, medium depth of field around f/3.5–f/5.6, give head room, realistic perspective, moderate subject-background separation, background remaining recognizable rather than heavily blurred. Slightly imperfect analog texture, soft highlight roll-off, natural exposure, subtle lens softness and authentic film color rendition. The image should feel observed rather than staged — quiet, spontaneous, intimate, youthful, conversational and effortlessly elegant. Avoid glossy commercial photography, dramatic lighting, heavy color grading, excessive contrast, artificial bokeh, HDR, extreme sharpness, overly polished skin, or contemporary fashion-editorial styling.\n\nAvoid: studio lighting, artificial beauty retouching, plastic skin, extreme HDR, excessive sharpness, extreme bokeh, oversaturated colors, heavy orange-and-teal grading, dramatic Hollywood lighting, perfect symmetry, artificial-looking steam, CGI appearance.\n","name":"Text Node 25","errorMessage":null},"width":670,"height":849,"style":{"width":670,"height":849},"measured":{"width":670,"height":849},"selected":false,"dragging":false,"resizing":false},{"id":"imageUpload-6gUlRjaxPCmj9ecqpJNYx","type":"imageUpload","position":{"x":18131.430877504652,"y":388.6108932262797},"data":{"imageUrl":"{{user-upload}}","filename":"Screenshot 2026-09-17 at 3.58.32 PM.png","uploadStatus":"completed","errorMessage":null,"mediaWidth":3838,"mediaHeight":2154,"mediaUrl":"{{user-upload}}","name":"Image 62"},"width":320,"height":274,"style":{"width":320,"height":274},"measured":{"width":320,"height":274},"selected":false,"dragging":false},{"id":"imageUpload-98jsC_hdVnWsobZE83mkj","type":"imageUpload","position":{"x":21511.672749504498,"y":-2979.5191743085607},"data":{"imageUrl":"{{user-upload}}","filename":"S6_1_Son.png","uploadStatus":"completed","errorMessage":null,"mediaWidth":1024,"mediaHeight":1024,"mediaUrl":"{{use