 reference image LuemHung and Image 000, which is small as a hand palm, with the exact red packaging, cream label, gold decorative borders, Thai typography, logo, illustrations and transparent rice window. Do not redesign, simplify, reinterpret or replace the packaging. Preserve the exact product identity and visual artwork from the reference. \nThe product should be slightly closer to camera than the woman and buffalo, making it a clear foreground hero while still keeping the human story visible behind it. Focus on the LuemHung product to create a deep depth of field (the MUM2 and buffalo are blurry). \n\nVisual style: a naturalistic French New Wave film aesthetic inspired by the intimate, observational cinema of Eric Rohmer. Bright natural daylight, soft summer sunlight, realistic outdoor locations, understated cinematic composition, candid everyday moments, relaxed and spontaneous body language, characters naturally integrated into their environment. Warm but restrained color palette with soft greens, pale blues, creamy whites and subtle earthy tones. Natural skin tones, gentle sunlight on faces, soft shadows, slightly lifted blacks and delicate film grain. Shot on 35mm film with a 50mm or 65mm lens, give head room, realistic perspective, moderate subject-background separation, background remaining recognizable rather than heavily blurred. Slightly imperfect analog texture, soft highlight roll-off, natural exposure, subtle lens softness and authentic film color rendition. The image should feel observed rather than staged — quiet, spontaneous, intimate, youthful, conversational and effortlessly elegant. Avoid glossy commercial photography, dramatic lighting, heavy color grading, excessive contrast, artificial bokeh, HDR, extreme sharpness, overly polished skin, or contemporary fashion-editorial styling.\n\nAvoid: studio photography, artificial commercial lighting, excessive HDR, oversaturated colors, heavy orange-and-teal grading, extreme background blur, plastic skin, CGI appearance, fantasy elements, exaggerated poses, distorted buffalo anatomy, redesigned packaging, incorrect product graphics or unreadable product branding.","name":"Text Node 27"},"width":879,"height":621,"style":{"width":879,"height":621},"measured":{"width":879,"height":621},"selected":false,"dragging":false,"resizing":false},{"id":"imageUpload-5he1XnDJbTzwP0_PPD5L3","type":"imageUpload","position":{"x":16881.326563004546,"y":923.6943734986215},"data":{"imageUrl":"{{user-upload}}","filename":"Screenshot 2026-09-17 at 4.04.06 PM.png","uploadStatus":"completed","errorMessage":null,"mediaWidth":862,"mediaHeight":1070,"mediaUrl":"{{user-upload}}","name":"LuemHung"},"width":320,"height":471,"style":{"width":320,"height":471},"measured":{"width":320,"height":471},"selected":false,"dragging":false},{"id":"imageUpload-IHtvvMzDvHosOgHLU0SwV","type":"imageUpload","position":{"x":18953.242798579853,"y":659.0763838705695},"data":{"imageUrl":"{{user-upload}}","filename":"Screenshot 2026-09-17 at 4.14.54 PM.png","uploadStatus":"completed","errorMessage":null,"mediaWidth":814,"mediaHeight":1032,"mediaUrl":"{{user-upload}}","name":"Buffalo"},"width":320,"height":479,"style":{"width":320,"height":479},"measured":{"width":320,"height":479},"selected":false,"dragging":false},{"id":"imageUpload-BjBBXp8fnjaBK3KEOaMn0","type":"imageUpload","position":{"x":17840.90356826941,"y":1175.8091668980428},"data":{"imageUrl":"{{user-upload}}","filename":"{{user-upload}}","uploadStatus":"completed","errorMessage":null,"mediaWidth":608,"mediaHeight":1088,"mediaUrl":"{{user-upload}}","name":"Image 70"},"width":320,"height":630,"style":{"width":320,"height":630},"measured":{"width":320,"height":630},"selected":false,"dragging":false},{"id":"textNode-yicMmiSN_mihfcYpBo4PY","type":"textNode","position":{"x":17945.754791537387,"y":859.150040857169},"data":{"text":"Revise Image 70, the woman should be the MUM2 who is wearing a sandal not boot. please change her boot to sandals. \n\nMake the red package product LuemHung smaller size.\n\nPut some bamboo basket, and bamboo tray with herbs on the table for decoration. DONT BLOCK the red package product.\n\nKeep the color tone. \n\nRemove all AI noises and AI artifacts.","name":"Text Node 28"},"width":320,"height":240,"style":{"width":320,"height":240},"measured":{"width":320,"height":240},"selected":false,"dragging":false},{"id":"imageGenerator-tcOJFA-wpaM8UUgkQPaA8","type":"imageGenerator","position":{"x":18342.978155754714,"y":1072.8576591248645},"data":{"model":"gpt-image","status":"completed","resultImage":"{{user-upload}}","errorMessage":null,"name":"Image 29","resolution":"","aspectRatio":"","quality":"high","imageSize":"portrait_16_9","results":[{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-17T08:35:14.162Z","runIndex":0},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-17T08:39:45.618Z","runIndex":1},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-17T08:43:05.834Z","runIndex":2},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-17T08:57:18.316Z","runIndex":3},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-17T09:00:40.008Z","runIndex":4}],"activeRunIndex":4,"mediaWidth":608,"mediaHeight":1088},"width":320,"height":658,"style":{"width":320,"height":658},"measured":{"width":320,"height":658},"selected":false,"dragging":false},{"id":"imageUpload-knKr-INLdPHeDWX95iQxS","type":"imageUpload","position":{"x":17431.24774033376,"y":957.3539818633247},"data":{"imageUrl":"{{user-upload}}","filename":"Screenshot 2026-09-17 at 4.28.47 PM.png","uploadStatus":"completed","errorMessage":null,"mediaWidth":640,"mediaHeight":690,"mediaUrl":"{{user-upload}}","name":"bamboo basket"},"width":320,"height":424,"style":{"width":320,"height":424},"measured":{"width":320,"height":424},"selected":false,"dragging":false},{"id":"imageUpload-YW_T8UGkyNy-A3WrVS4vy","type":"imageUpload","position":{"x":17078.692214613555,"y":1268.7648827958044},"data":{"imageUrl":"{{user-upload}}","filename":"